{"id":422,"name":"shellos","speciesId":422,"dex":422,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":76,"attack":48,"defense":48,"special-attack":57,"special-defense":62,"speed":34},"abilities":[{"name":"sticky-hold","hidden":false},{"name":"storm-drain","hidden":false},{"name":"sand-force","hidden":true}],"height":3,"weight":63,"baseExp":65,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/422.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/422.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/422.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/422.ogg","genus":"Sea Slug Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Lesma do Mar","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It lives along bodies of water. Its body shape has changed to suit its habitat."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat."},{"version":"sun","text":"For the most part, it makes its home along the seashore. Its color and form differ according to its habitat and the quality of its food."},{"version":"moon","text":"Purple mucus sticks to the hands of anyone who touches it. Take care, as the substance is troublesome to wash off."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"While they normally live in the sea, they can function on land, too, until their skin dries out."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"When it senses danger, a purple liquid oozes out of it. The liquid is thought to be something like greasy sweat."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon’s habitat shapes its physique. According to some theories, life in warm ocean waters causes this variation to develop."},{"version":"shield","text":"Subjecting this Pokémon to a strong force causes it to secrete a strange purple fluid. Though harmless, the fluid is awfully sticky."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Found in abundance on seashores bordering warm waters. Shellos are unexpectedly friendly and will crawl toward any person they see. Take care not to get coated in mucus!"}],"flavorPt":"Encontrado em abundância em praias margeando águas quentes. Shellos são inesperadamente amigáveis ​​e rastejarão em direção a qualquer pessoa que virem. Tome cuidado para não ficar coberto de muco!","genderRate":4,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["water1","indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"shellos","speciesId":422,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 30"],"species":"gastrodon","speciesId":423,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":422,"name":"shellos","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/422.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":29,"learn":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[24,"lv",5]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[8,"lv",29],[9,"lv",29],[10,"lv",29],[11,"lv",29],[14,"lv",29],[15,"lv",29],[16,"lv",29],[17,"lv",29],[18,"lv",29],[20,"lv",25],[20,"tm",0],[23,"lv",25],[25,"lv",25],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":54,"learn":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"id":55,"learn":[[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":56,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[24,"lv",47],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":57,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":58,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"i